                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In certain mammals, especially rabbits and other lagomorphs, the consumption of food pellets which are naturally produced by means of digestion, retention in the caecum, and expulsion through the anus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
