                                                "sense_id": "bbc62ddc-ce16-3d03-b634-a16c461dadd9",
                                                "text": "2008, A. Belenguer et al., \"Alternative methodologies to estimate ingestion of caecotrophes in growing rabbits,\" Livestock Science, vol. 115, no.1, p. 13,\nThe second group (T-2: 6 rabbits) was also fed the labelled diet but only during the last ten days of the fattening period when animals were fitted a neck collar to prevent caecotrophy."
                                            }
